# 🚨 Priority-Based Pothole Management

The system doesn't treat every pothole equally.

A **priority score** can be calculated using multiple factors:

```text
Priority Score
      │
      ├── Pothole Severity
      ├── Number of Reports
      ├── Road Importance
      ├── Traffic Level
      ├── Location
      └── Verification
```

Example:

```text
Severity       → 40%
Traffic        → 20%
Reports        → 15%
Road Importance→ 15%
Verification   → 10%
```

The final score can be converted into:

| Priority    | Meaning          |
| ----------- | ---------------- |
| 🔴 Critical | Immediate action |
| 🟠 High     | Urgent repair    |
| 🟡 Medium   | Schedule repair  |
| 🟢 Low      | Low urgency      |

