# 👥 Duplicate & Crowd Verification

Multiple citizens may report the same pothole.

The system can compare:

* GPS coordinates
* Distance between reports
* Time
* Image information

Example:

```text
User A ──┐
User B ──┼──> Same Location
User C ──┘
              ↓
       Crowd Verified
              ↓
       Higher Priority
```

This helps reduce duplicate complaints while increasing confidence in genuine reports.

