# 🔐 Role-Based Access

The application should enforce role-based authorization.

```text
User
 │
 ├── Report Pothole
 ├── View Own Reports
 └── Track Status


Officer
 │
 ├── View Potholes
 ├── Map
 ├── Verify Reports
 ├── View Details
 └── Update Repair Status


Admin
 │
 ├── Manage Users
 ├── Manage Officers
 ├── Manage Reports
 ├── Analytics
 └── Full System Access
```

Authentication and authorization should be separated:

```text
Firebase
   ↓
Who are you?
   ↓
Backend Database
   ↓
What role do you have?
   ↓
User / Officer / Admin
```

