# ⚙️ Installation

## 1. Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/pothole-pwa.git
cd pothole-pwa
```

## 2. Create Virtual Environment

### Windows

```bash
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate
```

### Linux/macOS

```bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
```

## 3. Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

